{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# Character｜结构图\n组件职责与跨模块接口。InitState 的先后顺序见 [[GGYGO_流程_角色初始化.canvas|流程图]]。[[Character/结构|结构文档]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1500,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"host","type":"text","text":"## 外部宿主：AGGYGOCombatantState\n`AttachAvatar(Pawn)` → 同步复制 Avatar、PawnExtension 和 ASC ActorInfo。\n`DetachAvatar(ExpectedPawn)` → 避免旧 Pawn 延迟销毁误清新 Avatar。\n[[Teams/结构]] · [[BossAI/结构]]","x":0,"y":240,"width":390,"height":245,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"data","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOPawnData\n`PawnClass` / `AbilitySets` / `AbilityGroupConfig` / `TagRelationshipMapping`\n`MovementSet` / `InputConfig` / `DefaultCameraMode`：分发给对应消费者。","x":0,"y":570,"width":390,"height":215,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"character","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOCharacterBase / HeroCharacter\nPawn 是 Avatar。基础角色承载 PawnExtension、Health、CMC；玩家派生再有 Hero 输入/相机职责。","x":510,"y":330,"width":430,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"extension","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOPawnExtensionComponent\n`SetPawnData(Data)` → 装配角色静态配置。\n`InitializeAbilitySystem(ASC, Owner)` → 建立 ActorInfo。\n`UninitializeAbilitySystem()` → Avatar 卸载。\nASC 就绪/卸载委托供 Health、CMC 订阅。","x":1050,"y":260,"width":430,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"health","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOHealthComponent\n`InitializeWithAbilitySystem(ASC)` → 绑定 HealthSet。\n`GetHealth/Poise()` → 只读数值。\n`StartDeath()` / `FinishDeath()` → 死亡状态边沿与复制。","x":1050,"y":580,"width":430,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"hero","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOHeroComponent（玩家）\n`InitializePlayerInput()` → 绑定 Native/Ability Action。\n`DetermineCameraMode()` → 默认/能力覆盖仲裁。\n`SetAbilityCameraMode(Class, SpecHandle)` / `Clear...` → 所有权管理。","x":510,"y":800,"width":430,"height":255,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"movement","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\n`SetMovementSet(Data)` → 配置步态/曲线。\n`HasMoveInput()` / `GetHorizontalSpeed()` / `IsTurnBackCurveDriven()` → 发布动画语义。\n[[Movement/结构]]","x":1050,"y":920,"width":430,"height":235,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"host","fromSide":"right","toNode":"extension","toSide":"left","label":"注入外部 ASC / Owner"},
